	"WHY": {"zh_CN": "你暴露的原因：", "en": "What gave you away:"},
	"TELL_VOICE": {"zh_CN": "你发出了声音。一个哑巴，被吓得出了声。", "en": "You made a sound. A mute, startled into a sound."},
	"THINK_DOOR_BLOOD": {"zh_CN": "血。他满脸都是血，领口、手上……还是湿的。跑？还是装作什么都看不见？", "en": "Blood. All over his face, his collar, his hands... still wet. Run? Or see nothing?"},
	"MAN_DOOR_0": {"zh_CN": "……你就是那个钢琴师？", "en": "...You're the pianist?"},
	"MAN_DOOR_1": {"zh_CN": "抱歉，刚在厨房，手上脏。", "en": "Sorry. I was in the kitchen. Dirty hands."},
	"HINT_DOOR_CHOICE": {"zh_CN": "装瞎进门——还是现在转身逃跑？（快速连按两下 W 疾跑）", "en": "Play blind and go in - or turn and run now? (Double-tap W to sprint)"},
	"OBJ_RUN_DOWN": {"zh_CN": "跑！下楼，逃出这栋楼", "en": "Run! Down the stairs, out of the building"},
	"HINT_SPRINT": {"zh_CN": "连按两下 W 并按住就能疾跑。屏幕下方的条是体力，跑空了只能喘着走。", "en": "Double-tap and hold W to sprint. The bar at the bottom is your breath; run it dry and you can only stagger."},
	"END_RAN_D": {"zh_CN": "你冲出单元门，一头扎进夜里。\n身后的楼道里，斧头拖在台阶上，一级，一级。", "en": "You burst out of the stairwell into the night.\nBehind you an axe drags down the steps, one by one."},
	"END_AXE_D": {"zh_CN": "斧头落下来的时候，你终于看清了他的脸。", "en": "When the axe came down, you finally saw his face clearly."},
	"TELL_RUN": {"zh_CN": "你跑了起来。盲人不会这样跑。", "en": "You ran. A blind man doesn't run like that."},
	"EVID_TITLE": {"zh_CN": "证据：", "en": "Evidence:"},
	"TIMER_BACK": {"zh_CN": "他大约 %d 秒后回来", "en": "He's back in about %d s"},
	"MAN_STAY": {"zh_CN": "……不，我就在这儿陪着你。", "en": "...No. I'll stay right here with you."},
	"MAN_WC": {"zh_CN": "失陪一下，我去趟洗手间。别停。", "en": "Excuse me a moment. The bathroom. Don't stop."},
	"MAN_BAGS": {"zh_CN": "我把垃圾拿下楼。门我会锁上——为了你的安全。", "en": "I'll take the rubbish down. I'll lock the door. For your safety."},
	"OBJ_FREE": {"zh_CN": "他走开了。去找能证明他杀了人的东西——或者坐着别动，等他回来", "en": "He's gone. Find proof of what he did - or sit still and wait for him"},
	"HINT_FREE": {"zh_CN": "这是你的机会，但不是必须的。在他回来之前回到钢琴旁边。", "en": "This is your chance - you don't have to take it. Be back at the piano before he returns."},
	"HINT_FREE_WC": {"zh_CN": "走廊对面是他的书房，门开着。", "en": "His study is across the hall. The door is open."},
	"HINT_FREE_BAGS": {"zh_CN": "上面有个阁楼——楼梯在厨房后面的杂物间里。书房的书架后面好像也有东西。", "en": "There's an attic - the stairs are in the utility room behind the kitchen. And something behind the study bookcase."},
	"THINK_BACK_EARLY": {"zh_CN": "门锁响了——他提前出来了！", "en": "The lock - he's coming out early!"},
	"THINK_HE_COMES": {"zh_CN": "他要回来了。快回去。", "en": "He's coming back. Go back. Now."},
	"MAN_WHERE": {"zh_CN": "……钢琴师？你去哪儿了？", "en": "...Pianist? Where did you go?"},
	"TELL_FOUND_HIDDEN": {"zh_CN": "他在暗处找到了你。盲人找不到那种地方。", "en": "He found you somewhere hidden. A blind man doesn't find places like that."},
	"TELL_SNOOPING": {"zh_CN": "他发现你在翻他的东西。", "en": "He caught you going through his things."},
	"MAN_FOUND_SNOOP": {"zh_CN": "这是我的地方。……你在找什么？", "en": "This is my place. ...What are you looking for?"},
	"TELL_WANDERED": {"zh_CN": "你离开了钢琴。", "en": "You left the piano."},
	"MAN_FOUND_LOST": {"zh_CN": "迷路了？来，跟我回去。", "en": "Lost? Come. This way."},
	"EV_RECORDER": {"zh_CN": "录音笔（按 R 录音）", "en": "A recorder (R to record)"},
	"EV_POLICY": {"zh_CN": "她的人寿保险单（书房文件柜）", "en": "Her life insurance policy (study files)"},
	"EV_RECEIPT": {"zh_CN": "钢琴弦的收据（书桌）", "en": "A receipt for piano wire (the desk)"},
	"EV_PHONE": {"zh_CN": "报警（书房的电话）", "en": "Call the police (the study phone)"},
	"EV_DIARY": {"zh_CN": "她的日记（阁楼）", "en": "Her diary (the attic)"},
	"EV_PHOTOS": {"zh_CN": "相机里的照片（阁楼）", "en": "The photographs in the camera (the attic)"},
	"EV_CANES": {"zh_CN": "一排白色盲杖（阁楼）", "en": "A rack of white canes (the attic)"},
	"EV_FREEZER": {"zh_CN": "冰柜里的东西（储藏室）", "en": "What's in the freezer (the pantry)"},
	"EV_IDS": {"zh_CN": "保险箱里的证件", "en": "The IDs in the safe"},
	"EV_KEY": {"zh_CN": "备用钥匙（保险箱）", "en": "The spare key (the safe)"},
	"THINK_POLICY": {"zh_CN": "人寿保险单。受益人是他。签字日期：上个月。", "en": "Life insurance. He's the beneficiary. Signed last month."},
	"THINK_RECEIPT": {"zh_CN": "一张收据：钢琴弦，低音，一卷。上周二。", "en": "A receipt: piano wire, bass gauge, one coil. Last Tuesday."},
	"THINK_PHONE": {"zh_CN": "我说不出话。拨了号，把听筒放在桌上——让他们听着。", "en": "I can't speak. I dial, and leave the receiver on the desk. Let them listen."},
	"THINK_DIARY": {"zh_CN": "她的日记。“第七个下周五来。他说这个是真瞎……我不信。”", "en": "Her diary. 'The seventh comes on Friday. He says this one is really blind... I don't believe him.'"},
	"THINK_DIARY_2": {"zh_CN": "最后一页：“保险箱的密码是我的生日，0914。他从来记不住。”", "en": "The last page: 'The safe is my birthday, 0914. He never remembers it.'"},
	"THINK_PHOTOS": {"zh_CN": "照片。一个个戴墨镜的男人坐在这架钢琴前。最后几张……他们都死了。", "en": "Photographs. Men in dark glasses at this piano. The last few... all of them dead."},
	"THINK_CANES": {"zh_CN": "六根白色盲杖，六副墨镜，排得整整齐齐。我是第七个。", "en": "Six white canes, six pairs of dark glasses, in a neat row. I'm the seventh."},
	"THINK_TRUNK": {"zh_CN": "她的裙子，叠好了，每一件上都别着日期。", "en": "Her dresses, folded, each one pinned with a date."},
	"THINK_FREEZER": {"zh_CN": "冰柜里……是手。很多只手，冻在一起。", "en": "In the freezer... hands. Many hands, frozen together."},
	"THINK_SAFE_OPEN": {"zh_CN": "0914。咔哒。备用钥匙——还有六个钱包，六张证件。", "en": "0914. Click. The spare key - and six wallets, six IDs."},
	"THINK_SAFE_LOCKED": {"zh_CN": "密码锁，四位数。大概是她的什么日子。", "en": "A combination lock. Four digits. Some date of hers, probably."},
	"THINK_CROWBAR": {"zh_CN": "一根撬棍。卧室那扇窗被钉死了……这个撬得开。", "en": "A crowbar. The bedroom window is nailed shut... this would open it."},
	"THINK_FUSE": {"zh_CN": "总电闸。要是灯全灭了……黑暗里，我比他熟。", "en": "The main switch. If the lights went out... I know the dark better than he does."},
	"THINK_BOOKCASE": {"zh_CN": "有一本书抽不出来。整个书架动了。", "en": "One book won't come out. The whole shelf moves."},
	"THINK_SKYLIGHT": {"zh_CN": "天窗外是屋顶。太高，跳不下去。但可以躲。", "en": "The roof, through the skylight. Too high to jump. Not too high to hide."},
	"THINK_NAILED": {"zh_CN": "窗户被钉死了。得找个东西撬开。", "en": "The window's nailed shut. I need something to pry it open."},
	"THINK_BLACKOUT": {"zh_CN": "全黑了。现在我们都是瞎子——但我装了这么多年。", "en": "Dark. Now we're both blind. But I've had years of practice."},
	"TELL_SNOOP": {"zh_CN": "他看见你在翻东西。", "en": "He saw you rummaging."},
	"ACT_OPEN": {"zh_CN": "[E] 打开", "en": "[E] Open"},
	"ACT_PUSH": {"zh_CN": "[E] 推", "en": "[E] Push"},
	"ACT_CLIMB": {"zh_CN": "[E] 爬", "en": "[E] Climb"},
	"ACT_PEEP": {"zh_CN": "[E] 从小孔往里看", "en": "[E] Look through"},
	"ACT_READ": {"zh_CN": "[E] 读", "en": "[E] Read"},
	"ACT_LOOK": {"zh_CN": "[E] 看", "en": "[E] Look"},
	"ACT_SAFE": {"zh_CN": "[E] 转密码锁", "en": "[E] Try the dial"},
	"ACT_FUSE": {"zh_CN": "[E] 拉电闸", "en": "[E] Pull the switch"},
	"ACT_SIT": {"zh_CN": "[E] 坐下", "en": "[E] Sit"},
	"ACT_SLEEP": {"zh_CN": "[E] 躺下 / 起来", "en": "[E] Lie down / get up"},
	"ACT_ENTER": {"zh_CN": "[E] 进去", "en": "[E] Go in"},
	"ACT_PUT": {"zh_CN": "[E] 摆上桌", "en": "[E] Lay it out"},
	"MAN_K_CALL": {"zh_CN": "钢琴师！过来搭把手——盘子在厨房。", "en": "Pianist! Make yourself useful. The plates are in the kitchen."},
	"OBJ_KITCHEN": {"zh_CN": "去厨房：穿过餐厅，后面那扇门", "en": "Go to the kitchen: through the dining room, the door at the back"},
	"HINT_KITCHEN": {"zh_CN": "餐厅在客厅西边（钢琴那面墙角的门）。顺着剁肉的声音走。", "en": "The dining room is west of the living room (the door in the piano wall's corner). Follow the chopping."},
	"THINK_KITCHEN": {"zh_CN": "砧板上……是一只手臂。她的。指甲还涂着。", "en": "On the block... an arm. Hers. The nails still painted."},
	"MAN_K_PLATES": {"zh_CN": "盘子在水池边，刀叉在抽屉里。摆两份，在餐厅。", "en": "Plates by the sink, cutlery in the drawer. Two places, in the dining room."},
	"OBJ_PLATES": {"zh_CN": "把盘子拿到餐桌上", "en": "Take the plates to the dining table"},
	"OBJ_CUTLERY": {"zh_CN": "把刀叉拿到餐桌上", "en": "Take the cutlery to the dining table"},
	"MAN_K_SIT": {"zh_CN": "很好。坐吧，开饭了。", "en": "Good. Sit down. Dinner is served."},
	"OBJ_DINNER": {"zh_CN": "在餐桌旁坐下", "en": "Sit down at the table"},
	"HINT_DINNER": {"zh_CN": "你的位子是摆着盘子的那张椅子，走过去就会坐下。", "en": "Your place is the chair with the plate; walk up to it and you sit down."},
	"THINK_DINNER_HEAD": {"zh_CN": "她的头。在我左手边的蛋糕架上。头发梳过了。眼睛闭着。", "en": "Her head. On the cake stand at my left. Her hair combed. Eyes closed."},
	"MAN_D_1": {"zh_CN": "她每天晚上给我做饭。今晚，我给她做。", "en": "She cooked for me every night. Tonight I cooked for her."},
	"MAN_D_2": {"zh_CN": "炖了一下午。吃吧，趁热。", "en": "Simmered all afternoon. Eat, while it's hot."},
	"HINT_EAT": {"zh_CN": "吃：按住鼠标左键把叉子送到嘴边，嚼，松开就咽下去。别吐，别出声。", "en": "Eat: hold the left mouse button to raise the fork, chew, let go to swallow. Don't gag. Don't make a sound."},
	"TELL_REFUSE": {"zh_CN": "你不肯吃。", "en": "You wouldn't eat."},
	"MAN_D_EAT": {"zh_CN": "吃。", "en": "Eat."},
	"MAN_D_GOOD": {"zh_CN": "好吃吗？", "en": "Was it good?"},
	"MAN_D_GOOD_NOD": {"zh_CN": "她会高兴的。", "en": "She'd be glad."},
	"MAN_D_GOOD_SHAKE": {"zh_CN": "不好吃？……她自己也总是做得太咸。", "en": "No? ...She always oversalted things too."},
	"THINK_RING": {"zh_CN": "牙咬到一个硬东西。……是她的婚戒。", "en": "Something hard between my teeth. ...Her wedding ring."},
	"MAN_D_RING": {"zh_CN": "小心，别把牙硌坏了。", "en": "Careful. Don't break a tooth."},
	"MAN_D_STORY_1": {"zh_CN": "你知道吗，你不是第一个来给她弹琴的。", "en": "You know, you're not the first to come and play for her."},
	"MAN_D_STORY_2": {"zh_CN": "前面那几个……都说自己是瞎子。全在撒谎。", "en": "The others... all said they were blind. Every one of them lying."},
	"MAN_D_STORY_3": {"zh_CN": "人一害怕，眼睛就藏不住。", "en": "When a man is afraid, his eyes can't hide it."},
	"SPK_HER": {"zh_CN": "她", "en": "Her"},
	"HER_DONT_EAT": {"zh_CN": "别吃我。", "en": "Don't eat me."},
	"MAN_D_WINE": {"zh_CN": "喝一口。今天刚开的。", "en": "Have a drink. I opened it today."},
	"HINT_DRINK": {"zh_CN": "按住鼠标左键喝。", "en": "Hold the left mouse button to drink."},
	"THINK_WINE": {"zh_CN": "又稠又温。这不是酒。", "en": "Thick, and warm. This isn't wine."},
	"MAN_D_DESSERT": {"zh_CN": "还有甜点。等我一下。", "en": "There's dessert. Wait here."},
	"MAN_D_EYES": {"zh_CN": "她的眼睛一直都很漂亮。", "en": "She always had such beautiful eyes."},
	"MAN_N_1": {"zh_CN": "……嘘。一点声音都别出。", "en": "...Shh. Not a sound."},
	"SPK_NEIGHBOUR": {"zh_CN": "楼下的老太太", "en": "The old woman downstairs"},
	"NB_1": {"zh_CN": "这么晚打扰了……我家天花板在漏水，红红的……", "en": "Sorry to bother you so late... my ceiling is leaking. It's red..."},
	"MAN_N_2": {"zh_CN": "浴缸的水忘了关，实在对不起。明天我上门赔您。", "en": "I left the bath running. I'm so sorry. I'll come and pay for it tomorrow."},
	"NB_2": {"zh_CN": "哎，这不是弹钢琴的小伙子吗？孩子，你还好吗？", "en": "Oh, isn't that the piano man? Are you all right, dear?"},
	"HINT_NEIGHBOUR": {"zh_CN": "点头：一切都好。摇头：告诉她出事了。", "en": "Nod: everything's fine. Shake your head: tell her something is wrong."},
	"NB_3A": {"zh_CN": "那……晚安了。", "en": "Well... good night then."},
	"NB_3B": {"zh_CN": "……我明白了。那我先下去了。", "en": "...I see. I'll... go back down, then."},
	"MAN_N_SHY": {"zh_CN": "他不太说话。晚安。", "en": "He doesn't talk much. Good night."},
	"MAN_N_WHY": {"zh_CN": "……你刚才为什么摇头？", "en": "...Why did you shake your head just now?"},
	"TELL_BETRAY": {"zh_CN": "你向邻居摇了头。", "en": "You shook your head at the neighbour."},
	"MAN_P_1": {"zh_CN": "睡前拍张照吧。给报纸用——钢琴师和他的听众。", "en": "One photograph before bed. For the papers: the pianist and his audience."},
	"MAN_P_2": {"zh_CN": "她喜欢挨着你坐。别动。", "en": "She likes sitting next to you. Don't move."},
	"MAN_P_COUNT": {"zh_CN": "三。二。一。", "en": "Three. Two. One."},
	"MAN_P_3": {"zh_CN": "这张会上所有报纸的。", "en": "This one will be in all the papers."},
	"FRAME_PHOTO": {"zh_CN": "一张照片：你和她坐在同一张琴凳上。", "en": "A photograph: you and her together on the bench."},
	"MAN_NIGHT_1": {"zh_CN": "太晚了，末班车早没了。你今晚就睡这儿。", "en": "It's late. The last bus is long gone. You'll sleep here tonight."},
	"MAN_NIGHT_2": {"zh_CN": "楼上有间小屋。跟我来。", "en": "There's a little room upstairs. Follow me."},
	"OBJ_ATTIC": {"zh_CN": "跟他上阁楼（杂物间里的楼梯）", "en": "Follow him up to the attic (the stairs in the utility room)"},
	"HINT_ATTIC": {"zh_CN": "杂物间在厨房后面。楼梯很陡，慢慢走。", "en": "The utility room is behind the kitchen. The stairs are steep; take them slowly."},
	"MAN_NIGHT_BED": {"zh_CN": "床在那边。睡吧。", "en": "The bed's over there. Sleep."},
	"OBJ_BED": {"zh_CN": "躺到床上（看着床按 E）", "en": "Lie down on the bed (look at it, press E)"},
	"HINT_BED": {"zh_CN": "躺下后按住空格可以闭眼。可以起来，但他进来时你最好在床上。", "en": "Lying down, hold SPACE to shut your eyes. You may get up - but be in bed when he looks in."},
	"MAN_NIGHT_GOOD": {"zh_CN": "晚安，钢琴师。", "en": "Good night, pianist."},
	"HINT_NIGHT": {"zh_CN": "装睡。无论看见什么，听见什么。", "en": "Play asleep. Whatever you see. Whatever you hear."},
	"MAN_NIGHT_UP": {"zh_CN": "起来。她想再听你弹一次。", "en": "Get up. She wants to hear you play once more."},
	"TELL_NOT_IN_BED": {"zh_CN": "他上来的时候，你不在床上。", "en": "When he came up, you weren't in bed."},
	"MAN_NIGHT_WATCH": {"zh_CN": "……睡着了？", "en": "...Asleep?"},
	"MAN_NIGHT_KNIFE": {"zh_CN": "……", "en": "..."},
	"MAN_F_1": {"zh_CN": "凌晨三点。她最喜欢这个时候。弹最后一首。", "en": "Three in the morning. Her favourite hour. Play the last one."},
	"MAN_F_SIRENS": {"zh_CN": "……警笛。是你。", "en": "...Sirens. It was you."},
	"TELL_SIRENS": {"zh_CN": "警笛响了。他知道是你叫来的。", "en": "The sirens came. He knew you'd called them."},
	"MAN_F_KNOW": {"zh_CN": "……我知道你看得见。", "en": "...I know you can see."},
	"MAN_F_NO": {"zh_CN": "……哈。不，你看不见。看得见的人早就跑了。", "en": "...Hah. No. You can't. Anyone who could see would have run."},
	"MAN_F_GO": {"zh_CN": "天亮了。回家吧。", "en": "It's getting light. Go home."},
	"END_LINE": {"zh_CN": "电  话", "en": "The Line"},
	"END_LINE_D": {"zh_CN": "那通电话一直没有挂断。\n天亮之前，警察敲开了那扇门，看见了浴缸里的她。", "en": "The line was never hung up.\nBefore dawn the police knocked on that door and found her in the bath."},
	"END_ATE_TAG": {"zh_CN": "你嘴里还留着那个味道。", "en": "You can still taste it."},
	"END_ROOF": {"zh_CN": "屋  顶", "en": "The Roof"},
	"END_ROOF_D": {"zh_CN": "你从天窗爬上屋顶，在湿滑的瓦片上一直趴到天亮。\n他没有追上来。他只是站在天窗底下，看着你。", "en": "You climbed out through the skylight and clung to the wet tiles until dawn.\nHe didn't follow. He just stood under the skylight, watching you."},
	"END_KEY_D": {"zh_CN": "备用钥匙转动了。你冲下楼梯，冲进夜里。\n他知道你看得见。他也知道你住在哪里。", "en": "The spare key turned. You ran down the stairs and into the night.\nHe knows you can see. He knows where you live."},
	"OBJ_OUTSIDE": {"zh_CN": "穿过小区，去她住的那栋楼——3 单元", "en": "Cross the estate to her block - Unit 3"},
	"HINT_OUTSIDE": {"zh_CN": "雾很大。沿着路灯走。", "en": "The fog is thick. Follow the street lamps."},
	"THINK_OUTSIDE_1": {"zh_CN": "她在电话里说：3 单元，4 楼。快点来。", "en": "On the phone she said: Unit 3, fourth floor. Come quickly."},
	"OBJ_FOREST": {"zh_CN": "逃进树林，找到通往公路的路", "en": "Escape into the forest and find the road"},
	"HINT_FOREST": {"zh_CN": "他追来了。疾跑会喘不过气；躲进灌木能缓一缓——别出声。", "en": "He's coming. Sprinting costs breath; hide in the bushes to catch it - silently."},
	"END_FOREST": {"zh_CN": "公  路", "en": "The Road"},
	"END_FOREST_D": {"zh_CN": "你冲出树林，摔在公路上。一辆卡车的灯照亮了你。\n树林边上，一个拿斧头的人影站了很久，才退回黑暗里。", "en": "You burst out of the trees onto the road. A truck's headlights find you.\nAt the edge of the forest a figure with an axe stands a long time, then steps back into the dark."},
	"TELL_FLASH": {"zh_CN": "闪光灯亮的时候你眨了眼。", "en": "You blinked at the flash."},
	"OBJ_CHASE": {"zh_CN": "逃出去：保险箱里的备用钥匙、撬开卧室的窗、阁楼的天窗——或者躲起来", "en": "Get out: the spare key in the safe, pry open the bedroom window, the attic skylight - or hide"},
	"HINT_CHASE_V3": {"zh_CN": "他锁了大门，钥匙在他身上。书房保险箱里有备用钥匙；杂物间的撬棍能撬开卧室被钉死的窗；阁楼有天窗；总电闸也在杂物间。也可以躲：衣柜、餐桌底下、储藏室。别出声。", "en": "He's locked the front door and pocketed the key. The study safe holds a spare; the crowbar in the utility room opens the nailed bedroom window; the attic has a skylight; the fuse box is in the utility room too. Or hide: wardrobes, under the dining table, the pantry. Not a sound."},
