	"STORY_10": {"zh_CN": "而开门的男人，看见他的墨镜和盲杖，忽然笑了。", "en": "And the man who opened the door looked at his dark glasses and his white cane, and smiled."},
	"STORY_SKIP": {"zh_CN": "按住 空格 跳过", "en": "Hold SPACE to skip"},
